		(property "Description" "ESP32-WROOM-32E-H4: 4 MB, -40..+105 C grade (the plain -32E is 85 C, and this revision exists because the die reached 87 C). Soldered module, antenna toward the board edge. Standard PCBA only at JLC. ALTERNATE: ESP32-WROOM-32UE-N4 (C2934568, 85 C grade) -- identical pads, U.FL instead of the PCB antenna; fit with a U.FL-to-SMA bulkhead pigtail through the enclosure for a remote antenna. Rev 1.1."
